WEBVTT

1
00:00:06,960 --> 00:00:08,960
Boss Pei must have tasted the taste of pork.

2
00:00:08,960 --> 00:00:11,460
These ten pounds just arrived yesterday. I've been short of them recently.

3
00:00:11,460 --> 00:00:12,960
I can guarantee the taste of beer

4
00:00:12,960 --> 00:00:16,100
But you have to think that entertaining guests is not a priority

5
00:00:16,100 --> 00:00:17,100
Then forget it

6
00:00:17,100 --> 00:00:29,560
Boss Lin, bring me two boxes

7
00:00:29,560 --> 00:00:31,060
I also want these ten pounds of meat

8
00:00:31,060 --> 00:00:33,190
A total of 10,720

9
00:00:33,190 --> 00:00:40,950
Dashan, get two boxes of Happy Beer

10
00:00:40,950 --> 00:00:42,450
Give Boss Pei a car
